{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52882","headline":"题泗水亭 · 许远","name":"题泗水亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风落东林，绿叶翳重阴。\n流莺坐花坞，宛传来清音。\n和光沛天地，乐意同人心。\n卷帘出庭户，独立苍苔深。\n（《海昌胜迹志》卷二。\n此首承陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}